{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o114a","title":"彗星东方现彭旦起兵","accounts":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o114a-account","label":"《吴主传第二》正文","text":"彗星东方现彭旦起兵","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o114a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wuzhu-p0089","role":"起兵","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o114a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":236,"label":"冬十月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wuzhu-y236","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wuzhu-q-o113","basis":"冬十月"},"evidence":["wuzhu-e-o114a-q","wuzhu-q-o113","houfei-q-o025","houfei-q-b-64a27e8dc3dd5339d73a"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuzhu-e-o114a-q","source_order":[47,565,"O114a"],"order":8330},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o119a","title":"陆逊讨平彭旦","accounts":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o119a-account","label":"《吴主传第二》正文","text":"陆逊讨平彭旦","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o119a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"xianzhu-p0115","role":"平乱","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o119a-q"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0089","role":"被破","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o119a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":237,"label":"二月及其年","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wuzhu-y237","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wuzhu-q-o115","basis":"二月及其年"},"evidence":["wuzhu-e-o119a-q","wuzhu-q-o115","houfei-q-o026","mingdi-q-o052","mingdi-q-o059","mingdi-q-b-78ee587f18f11aa30bd9"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuzhu-e-o119a-q","source_order":[47,593,"O119a"],"order":8335}],"persons":[{"id":"wuzhu-p0089","name":"彭旦","evidence":["wuzhu-q-o114"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wuzhu-m-o114-wuzhu-p0089","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wuzhu-q-o114"]},{"id":"wuzhu-m-o119-wuzhu-p0089","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wuzhu-q-o119"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"houfei-q-b-64a27e8dc3dd5339d73a","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-64a27e8dc3dd5339d73a","layer":"modern","quote":"〖16〗四年：青龙四年（公元 236）。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":114,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-bd98b8bd7ce8c71de9ac","start":0,"end":20},{"id":"houfei-q-o025","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-0744a279ae4c62a54e64","layer":"original","quote":"青龙二年春，追谥后兄俨曰安城乡穆侯。夏，吴贼寇扬州，以像为伏波将军〖12〗，持节，监诸将东征〖13〗。还，复为射声校尉〖14〗。三年薨〖15〗，追赠卫将军，改封魏昌县，谥曰贞侯。子畅嗣。又封畅弟温、4 、艳，皆为列侯。四年〖16〗，改逸、俨本封，皆曰魏昌侯，谥因故〖17〗。封俨世妇刘为东乡君〖18〗，又追封逸世妇张为安喜君。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":97,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":163},{"id":"houfei-q-o026","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-365be41815d34bbf6899","layer":"original","quote":"景初元年夏，有司议定七庙。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":119,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":13},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-78ee587f18f11aa30bd9","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-78ee587f18f11aa30bd9","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：景初二年（公元 238 ）。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":438,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-917b5dc4aecce5a0dcf4","start":0,"end":20},{"id":"mingdi-q-o052","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-26b7ecd6c3ecce777040","layer":"original","quote":"景初元年春（正）〔二〕月，壬辰〖1〗，山茌县言黄龙现〖2〗。﹝一﹞于是有司奏，以为魏得地统〖3〗，宜以建丑之月为正〖4〗。三月，定历改年为孟夏四月；﹝二﹞服色尚黄〖5〗；牺牲用白〖6〗；戎事乘黑首白马〖7〗，建大赤之旂〖8〗；朝会，建大白之旗。﹝三﹞改太和历曰景初历〖9〗：其春夏秋冬孟仲季月，虽与正岁不同〖10〗，至于郊祀、迎气、礿祠、蒸尝、巡狩、蒐田、分至启闭、班宣时令、中气早晚、敬授民事〖11〗，皆以正岁斗建为历数之序〖12〗。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":363,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":218},{"id":"mingdi-q-o059","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-5790b2efe14805978c50","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，诏太尉司马宣王。率众讨辽东。﹝一﹞","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":434,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":26},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o114a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-7674037114d72d6d6497","layer":"original","quote":"冬十月，彗星现于东方〖22〗。鄱阳贼彭旦等为乱。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":53,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":24},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o119a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-12e8498922ce74ebee27","layer":"original","quote":"二月，陆逊讨彭旦等。其年，皆破之。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":81,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":17},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o113","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-56f9d22ba18041334d05","layer":"original","quote":"五年春〖15〗，铸大钱，一当五百。诏使吏民输铜〖16〗，计铜畀直〖17〗；设盗铸之科〖18〗。（二）〔三〕月，武昌言甘露降于礼宾殿。辅吴将军张昭卒〖19〗。中郎将吾粲获李桓〖20〗；将军唐咨〖21〗，获罗厉等。自十月不雨，至于夏。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":52,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":115},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o114","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-7674037114d72d6d6497","layer":"original","quote":"冬十月，彗星现于东方〖22〗。鄱阳贼彭旦等为乱。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":53,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":24},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o115","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-b115e01f1969ebfec39b","layer":"original","quote":"六年春正月〖1〗，诏曰：“夫三年之丧〖2〗，天下之达制〖3〗，人情之极痛也；贤者割哀以从礼〖4〗，不肖者勉而致之〖5〗。世治道泰，上下无事，君子不夺人情，故三年不逮孝子之门〖6〗；至于有事，则杀礼以从宜〖7〗，腰绖而处事〖8〗。故圣人制法，有礼无时则不行〖9〗。遭丧不奔，非古也；盖随时之宜，以义断恩也。前故设科：长吏在官〖10〗，当须交代〖11〗。而故犯之〖12〗；虽随纠坐〖13〗，犹已废旷〖14〗。方事之殷〖15〗，国家多难；凡在官司〖16〗，宜各尽节，先公后私：而不恭承，甚非谓也〖17〗！中外群僚，其更平议〖18〗；务令得中，详为节度。”","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":77,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":274},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o119","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-12e8498922ce74ebee27","layer":"original","quote":"二月，陆逊讨彭旦等。其年，皆破之。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":81,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":17}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
